rough the thicket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERCOME OBSTACLE COURSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.poster.avif?t=1767901989\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.webm?t=1767901989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.mp4?t=1767901989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivers, swamps, impassable thickets, and steep cliffs will stand in your way. Jump, avoid traps, and clear your path with explosives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE FAIRYTALE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.poster.avif?t=1767901989\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.webm?t=1767901989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.mp4?t=1767901989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of fairy tales where nothing is what it seems and familiar characters take on new forms. Discover hidden paths, loot chests, and uncover all the mysteries of the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new reimagining of familiar fairytale characters<br></li><li>A dark narrative hidden beneath a cheerful story<br></li><li>Unique cartoonish visual style<br></li><li>Dynamic gameplay</li></ul>","developers":["Norllina Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/d0b38d1e2f2b86621001f34f450bc331eb532e3f/header.jpg?t=1767901989","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3934000/1276080501/2a17c5b4700ecaac50aa1e7ec4d7a739c48716a2/1767900609/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767901988","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3934000/1276080501/2a17c5b4700ecaac50aa1e7ec4d7a739c48716a2/1767900609/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767901988","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3934000/1276080501/2a17c5b4700ecaac50aa1e7ec4d7a739c48716a2/1767900609/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767901988","id":257261869,"name":"Multitales: Hood, Gun and Contraband - First Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257261869/da4f711790a9cae72608b5b0b34c7c228fbf6feb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767901988"}],"name":"Multitales: Hood, Gun & Contraband","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 @ 3.1 GHz or AMD FX-6300 @ 3.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 670 or analogue with 2GB VRAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 (6 core with 3,5 GHz) or Intel i5-10400F (6 core with 2,9 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 